y on established paths and go with a friend.","short_summary":"A nearby outdoor reset with city views.","evidence_claim":"San Francisco Recreation and Parks describes Buena Vista Park as the city’s oldest park, with winding trails, coast live oaks, and views from its upper slopes.","source_url":"https://www.sfrecpark.org/Facilities/Facility/Details/Buena-Vista-Park-155","source_title":"Buena Vista Park | San Francisco Recreation and Parks","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official park hours are 6 a.m.–10 p.m.; visit in daylight and follow posted park rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"golden-gate-park-shuttle","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Golden Gate Park Free Shuttle","title":"9. Ride the park shuttle","subtitle":"Golden Gate Park’s JFK Promenade route","notes":"Use the official free shuttle to connect a few Golden Gate Park destinations without trying to cover the whole park on foot. Check the schedule before leaving campus.","short_summary":"A low-cost way to sample several park landmarks.","evidence_claim":"San Francisco Recreation and Parks says the Golden Gate Park Shuttle is free, runs daily, and stops at museums, gardens, and the Conservatory of Flowers.","source_url":"https://www.sfrecpark.org/1617/Golden-Gate-Park-Free-Shuttle","source_title":"Golden Gate Park Free Shuttle | San Francisco Recreation and Parks","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official service runs 9 a.m.–6 p.m. on weekends and holidays, and noon–6 p.m. weekdays; check for updates before travel.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"japanese-tea-garden","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Japanese Tea Garden","title":"10. End at the Japanese Tea Garden","subtitle":"Golden Gate Park, 75 Hagiwara Tea Garden Drive","notes":"Finish the weekend with a slow garden walk and a few photos of the pagoda and landscape. Arrive early on a listed free-hour day if that timing suits you.","short_summary":"A clear final destination for a quieter Sunday outing.","evidence_claim":"Gardens of Golden Gate Park lists the Japanese Tea Garden at 75 Hagiwara Tea Garden Drive and offers a free hour Monday, Wednesday, and Friday from 9–10 a.m.","source_url":"https://gggp.org/visit/admissions-hours/","source_title":"Hours & Admissions | Gardens of Golden Gate Park","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The garden is open daily; last entry changes seasonally. The documented free hour is Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, 9–10 a.m.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
